An executable of aildb, such as build/aildb, is made by the compiler of
AIL (https://github.com/CristianosLeite/ail) and has in it code of the
library of AIL (lib/std) and code that the compiler writes. No file of
AIL is in the source repository of aildb, which fetches AIL when it is
built. AIL is distributed under the MIT License, and whoever passes on an
executable of aildb passes on this notice with it:

